		<div class="order-1 xl:order-2 col-span-2 xl:col-span-1 flex flex-col mt-28">
			
			
			<div class="text-2xl mt-8"><strong>Estimated Market Value:</strong> $<span class="domain-estimated-price-min"></span> to $<span class="domain-estimated-price-max"></span></div>
